-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number of observations              455   ->   383         
Number of variables                   4   ->   5           
j variable (2 values)                 t   ->   (dropped)
xij variables:
                                      s   ->   s0 s1
                                    phi   ->   phi0 phi1
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

